        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000008",
        "block_index": 8,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Here's why it's so important for children to get the COVID-19 vaccine as soon as they're eligible, plus answers to parents' top questions.",
